WEBVTT

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:24.870
Saint Seiya

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:33.770
The Underworld.

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:37.350
The land of the dead, ruled by Hades.

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:42.900
Young warriors of hope have entered
the Underworld in the name of peace.

00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:47.010
They are at the mercy of destiny.

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:50.260
Yes, even the bonds of brotherhood.

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:50.420
Ikki! The Punch of Lament
Yes, even the bonds of brotherhood.

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:58.720
Ikki! The Punch of Lament

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:07.980
Die, Phoenix.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:20.620
What is going on? My body won't move!

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:27.940
What? My hand is moving on its own.

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:32.040
Lord Hades!

00:02:32.910 --> 00:02:34.270
My body

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:38.900
is ignoring my mind and attacking me.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:41.980
What's this?

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:44.980
Brother.

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:48.440
Shun. I can see Shun's soul!

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:55.430
Brother, now is the only
chance to defeat Hades.

00:02:55.590 --> 00:03:01.740
Now, don't worry about my body
and blow the soul of Hades away!

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:04.700
Shun, you must be...

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:09.570
Lord Hades!

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:16.550
Shun's body is retaliating
against Lord Hades.

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:18.060
How could it be?

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:20.770
Shun, did you accept Hades into your body

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:24.140
because you were prepared to die?

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:27.970
What? What do you mean?

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:35.100
Are you saying Shun received Lord Hades
into his body to create this opportunity?

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:36.110
Exactly.

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:42.080
Nonsense! He would sacrifice his life?

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:45.030
Yes, Shun is that type of guy.

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:52.010
His constellation, Andromeda,
sacrificed herself to save the world.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:57.150
Shun is the Andromeda Saint.

00:03:57.480 --> 00:04:00.810
And he has fought, sacrificing his body.

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:06.240
If someone could be saved
by him sacrificing his body,

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:09.640
he would gladly do so.

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:12.190
Now, do you understand?

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:13.340
What?

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:20.000
Shun was not born to be the body of Hades.

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:25.900
He was born to protect the
world as the Andromeda Saint.

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:26.800
Brother!

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:30.500
Hurry! Hurry and attack, brother.

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:34.090
Brother.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:38.930
Shun.

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:41.160
Stop, Ikki!

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:55.300
I won't let you lay your hands on Lord Hades.

00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:58.750
Andromeda is his temporary form.

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:00.230
Die!

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:09.260
What? What is that?

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:15.860
Rolling Defense?

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:23.210
I don't believe it. The chain that Andromeda
abandoned is protecting Phoenix.

00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:28.930
Shun.

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:32.830
Now, brother, I won't let anyone interrupt.

00:05:32.990 --> 00:05:34.350
Hurry and attack.

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:41.240
If you don't hurry, my body will
be completely taken over by Hades.

00:05:41.720 --> 00:05:42.720
What?

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:44.720
Brother.

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:46.740
Shun.

00:05:47.170 --> 00:05:49.320
Brother, don't be sad.

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:56.580
I'm happy that I can save
the people on Earth.

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:59.180
So don't hesitate.

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:02.490
Attack without hesitation, brother.

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:03.720
Shun.

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:07.490
Brother, brother!

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:10.240
What's wrong? Man up, Shun.

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:12.420
But... But...

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:20.250
Listen, Shun. Stay strong whatever happens.

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:24.820
Overcome any challenge
and come back to Japan.

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:30.240
Yes. I look forward to seeing you again.

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:31.780
I look forward to it.

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:34.620
Shun.

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:41.210
When we reunited after obtaining the Cloth,

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:45.170
I called you weak for shedding tears.

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:47.140
But now I understand.

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:52.630
Your compassion and true
strength are in your tears.

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:00.280
Shun.

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:05.870
Brother, hit me in the
name of peace on Earth!

00:07:06.740 --> 00:07:09.980
Well said, Shun.

00:07:10.220 --> 00:07:13.160
You truly are my brother.

00:07:13.350 --> 00:07:16.830
You truly are Athena's Saint
that protects the world.

00:07:19.940 --> 00:07:25.280
Shun, I'll take your life to save the world!

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:30.220
Fool! Stop, Ikki!

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:31.270
Shun.

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:32.590
Brother.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:55.490
Shun. Dear Shun...

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:01.860
What?

00:08:02.860 --> 00:08:04.140
That Cosmo.

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:05.780
There's no doubt about it.

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:09.140
Ikki killed Shun.

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:11.670
What is this Cosmo?

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:15.300
This is Phoenix's Cosmo. I felt it before.

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:20.650
But it lacks the burning intensity.
Instead it's full of grief.

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:24.010
Hold it, Canon!

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:25.330
Ikki.

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:27.020
Did you...

00:08:30.050 --> 00:08:31.600
This Cosmo.

00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:45.120
Ikki killed Shun.

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:57.460
Shun. Dear Shun.

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:02.780
Forgive me, Shun.

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:07.810
Brother.

00:09:09.430 --> 00:09:12.970
I'll pull Hades out of you right now.

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:16.050
Now, come out, Hades!

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:25.840
This is Hades?

00:09:26.970 --> 00:09:31.630
How dare you inhabit Shun's body?

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:36.760
You bastard. You bastard!

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:47.680
I did it. I crushed the soul of Hades.

00:09:54.560 --> 00:09:58.690
Shun, get a hold of yourself.
I defeated Hades. Shun!

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:00.490
Brother...

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:05.660
I'm glad. Now we...

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:07.520
Shun!

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:16.920
Brother, get away from
me. Hades is still in me.

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:18.330
What?

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:23.540
What is that?

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:29.610
Is this the real Hades?

00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:31.140
Stop.

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:32.660
Stop it.

00:10:32.970 --> 00:10:36.660
Stop it!

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:40.950
Ikki killed Shun right now. And then...

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:46.960
What was that monstrous creature
that came out of Shun?

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:50.180
Was I dreaming?

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:56.530
I have no memory since
Shun turned into Hades.

00:10:58.270 --> 00:11:00.150
Where am I?

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:04.100
What happened to Shun
after turning into Hades?

00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:06.770
Shun.

00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:09.710
What happened to you?

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:15.350
Lord Hades!

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:29.180
You stopped your attack, Ikki.

00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:32.670
Even at that incredible speed.

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:36.690
You greatly damaged your fist by stopping it.

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:40.270
Why did you stop it, Phoenix?

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:44.860
You're softer than I thought.

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:51.420
Do you value your brother's life more than
the billions of innocent lives on Earth?

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:59.080
Now your only chance to
stop the Greatest Eclipse

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:00.530
was wasted.

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:04.750
What's this?

00:12:05.310 --> 00:12:08.460
Shun's hair is changing color!

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:11.100
This phenomenon

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:16.670
also occurred when Saga turned evil.

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:24.590
Could it be?

00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:31.110
That's right. Now Shun's
body is completely mine.

00:12:31.470 --> 00:12:34.260
Down to every strand of hair.

00:12:34.260 --> 00:12:34.900
What?

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.800
Shun's soul

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:38.910
is now completely eradicated.

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:40.780
Shun!

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:59.840
Finally, you have attained your
completed form, Lord Hades.

00:12:59.890 --> 00:13:04.020
Pandora, dispose his body with care.

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:04.970
Yes.

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:09.180
Soon the Greatest Eclipse will begin.

00:13:09.530 --> 00:13:13.130
The world will turn into the land
of the dead, the Underworld.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:18.950
What? What is this Cosmo?

00:13:19.760 --> 00:13:20.800
It can't be!

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:24.370
Ikki.

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:30.620
Is anyone here?

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:31.710
Yes.

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:34.210
Valentine, at your service.

00:13:34.400 --> 00:13:38.290
Dispose Phoenix's corpse in the Cocytus.

00:13:38.490 --> 00:13:42.490
He's an enemy but also the
brother of Lord Hades' flesh.

00:13:43.430 --> 00:13:45.600
Be respectful.

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:48.070
Understood.

00:13:51.570 --> 00:13:52.370
Excuse me.

00:13:57.490 --> 00:13:58.730
Lord Hades.

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:01.570
What's wrong, Lord Hades?

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:07.700
Nothing. I just had a bad
feeling. It's nothing.

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:12.980
I'm sorry, you must be fatigued.

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:15.780
Will you return to the temple?

00:14:17.130 --> 00:14:20.600
No, I will rest here a while longer.

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:24.800
Don't let anyone disturb me. You are excused.

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:25.730
Yes.

00:14:27.490 --> 00:14:29.690
Excuse me.

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:46.930
Ikki.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:57.450
Who's there?

00:14:57.980 --> 00:15:00.890
I said I don't want to be disturbed.

00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:03.420
I suggest you go away.

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:10.010
I cannot, now that I finally
am able to meet you.

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:12.980
What? Who are you?

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:24.530
Gold Saint, Virgo Shaka.

00:15:27.140 --> 00:15:29.820
Hades, I shall now take your life.

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:44.470
My body won't move at all. I
need to get out of here somehow.

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:49.050
I need to get the Athena Cloth to Miss Saori.

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:52.190
Who is it?

00:15:56.410 --> 00:15:59.060
Ikki. It's you, Ikki.

00:15:59.380 --> 00:16:02.330
Ikki. Hey, Ikki. Are you all right?

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:05.900
Don't be surprised.

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:11.860
This is like a hell for Saints.

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:13.060
What?

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:17.060
This is the Cocytus of the Eighth Prison.

00:16:17.060 --> 00:16:22.570
Those who commit the greatest sin of
retaliating against Gods are sent here.

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:28.340
That's why most of the Saints who went
against Lord Hades have fallen here.

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:31.120
Look around you.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:32.040
What?

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:40.500
Could it be...

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:47.230
The dead here are Athena's Saints
who aimed their fists at Lord Hades.

00:16:47.300 --> 00:16:53.830
Millions of Saints who have
died in past holy wars.

00:16:53.940 --> 00:16:58.800
Cocytus, the Ice Hell that Saints fall into.

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:07.020
All who are here have once fought for
love and justice on Earth in the past.

00:17:07.270 --> 00:17:09.200
And not only the past.

00:17:12.180 --> 00:17:13.070
Mu.

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:16.540
Aioria! Miro!

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:29.710
That's right. There are Saints
here who were sent to hell alive.

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:32.770
No way.

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:39.250
It's only a matter of time
before you join them.

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:43.750
No, those three Gold Saints
might already be dead.

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:46.650
Damn you.

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:51.290
Valentine. I am Harpy Valentine.

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:55.690
I applaud you for making it this far.

00:17:55.890 --> 00:17:58.310
But this is where we part.

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:00.130
Wait!

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:03.090
Let me out of here.

00:18:03.780 --> 00:18:05.560
That's wishful thinking.

00:18:06.130 --> 00:18:10.520
Valentine, do you not want Athena's Cloth?

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:13.190
Athena's Cloth?

00:18:13.410 --> 00:18:19.210
That's right, the Cloth of Athena you
all have been desperately searching for.

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:22.190
You'll get it if you defeat me.

00:18:24.480 --> 00:18:29.520
Now, let me out and try
to get the Athena Cloth.

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:32.640
You really have it?

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:34.560
Right, I have it here.

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:43.170
Where are you hiding it?

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:46.260
I'll give it to you now!

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:55.660
Fool.

00:18:57.590 --> 00:18:58.610
My body.

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:04.580
Your weak kick didn't even scratch
me. Now, give me the Athena Cloth.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:08.600
My entire body is numb like I have frostbite.

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:11.410
I'm finished like this.

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:13.540
So hand it over.

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:18.810
Don't you understand?

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:24.970
You're in the Cocytus and
your temperature is dropping.

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:27.820
You have no energy to fight!

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:34.070
If you won't bring it out, it's fine.

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:38.080
I'll paralyze you and search you slowly!

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:49.920
If you had handed it over, you
wouldn't have had to suffer.

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:58.900
Pegasus, what's the use of fighting
back? You'll just suffer more.

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:05.480
I told you, you can have the
Athena Cloth once you defeat me.

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:08.670
I'm not completely down yet.

00:20:08.820 --> 00:20:13.480
I won't go down as long as the fire
of my life is even slightly burning!

00:20:13.740 --> 00:20:16.120
Pegasus Meteor Punch!

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:24.300
Either you don't know when to
give up or you're just suicidal.

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:30.500
Fine, then I'll completely defeat
you. I'll blow out your fire of life.

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:31.910
Take this, Pegasus!

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:36.040
Greed for Life!

00:20:48.920 --> 00:20:52.870
Shaka, I hear you have
been accompanying Athena.

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:55.480
Where have you been wandering?

00:20:56.390 --> 00:21:00.920
I didn't imagine you were in hell.

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:04.450
I was heading to Elysion with Athena.

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:06.910
That's nice to hear.

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:11.300
Elysion is upstream of the Acheron River.

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:13.440
Beyond the Lethe River.

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:18.220
Even Athena will find it
difficult to reach it.

00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:21.500
Yes, we wandered for a while.

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:26.420
That's when we felt your
Cosmo and headed this way.

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:28.900
So where is Athena?

00:21:29.170 --> 00:21:33.560
It does not concern you,
because you're going to die.

00:21:37.570 --> 00:21:39.520
Demon Pacifier!

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:41.680
I shall now take your life!

00:21:41.680 --> 00:21:43.500
Wait, Shaka.

00:21:48.260 --> 00:21:50.690
You must not attack Hades.

00:21:52.960 --> 00:21:57.850
So the approaching Cosmo was yours.

00:22:01.260 --> 00:22:02.320
Athena.

00:22:03.330 --> 00:22:04.410
Hades.

00:24:02.150 --> 00:24:04.740
Those who defy the Gods lie in Cocytus.

00:24:04.740 --> 00:24:08.720
The relentless attacks from the Specters
try to extinguish the flame of my life.

00:24:09.280 --> 00:24:11.670
But I'm not going down yet.

00:24:11.940 --> 00:24:16.970
This Cloth... Until I give Athena her Cloth,
my Cosmo will continue to burn.

00:24:17.250 --> 00:24:19.940
Wait for me, Miss Saori!

00:24:20.860 --> 00:24:24.320
Saint Seiya: "Athena! Sacrificing Your Life."

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:27.620
Have you ever felt your Cosmo?
